<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - Texas Public Finance Authority.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - Texas Public Finance Authority.</headline>
<text>
<p>TEXAS PUBLIC FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $82,505,000</p>
<p>STATE OF TEXAS GENERAL OBLIGATION</p>
<p>AND REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996C</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes, Inc.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Artemis Capital Group, Inc.</p>
<p>Estrada Hinojosa &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Coastal Securities</p>
<p>Stephens Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
